### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Get Payment Providers
# Retrieve available payment providers
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/providers
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Payment Status
# Check the status of a payment using reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/status?reference=your_payment_reference_here
Content-Type: application/json

